msgctxt "224\t343"
msgid "Guess this is the end of the line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "353\t413"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "449\t567"
msgid ""
"Gonna be real lonesome\\n"
"without ya, Kiryu-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604\t701"
msgid "Take care of Daigo for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "706\t766"
msgid "Ya got my word."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "771\t855"
msgid "There's just one thing worryin' me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900\t960"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024\t1198"
msgid ""
"If he starts goin' down a weird path,\\n"
"don't think I'll be able to stop him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200\t1259"
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1278\t1332"
msgid "Daigo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1335\t1489"
msgid ""
"I mean the sixth chairman.\\n"
"He's real trustin', just like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520\t1625"
msgid ""
"Hope he doesn't let anyone\\n"
"pull the wool over his eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1636\t1760"
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\\n"
"Daigo's young, but he's not a fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1927\t1997"
msgid "I should get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2026\t2150"
msgid "The Tojo Clan's in your hands now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2482\t2590"
msgid "The hell'd I get myself into this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2654\t2712"
msgid "Eh, whatever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2714\t2778"
msgid "Goro Majima's..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2794\t2872"
msgid "Gonna rule the fuckin' world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2902\t2997"
msgid "Won't be a walk in the park..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2999\t3202"
msgid ""
"But hey, Kiryu-chan beat me fair n' square.\\n"
"Guess I gotta go full throttle!"
msgstr ""